          Bus/Train
        </p> <p class="regular size-20 dark-grey u-pt-10">The closest train station is Châtillon/Saint-Vincent. From Châtillon, as well as from Turin and Milan, there is a bus service to/from Breuil-Cervinia Valtournenche.</p> <p class="demi size-25 u-upp u-sm-pt-30 u-pt-50">
